**Для перевода извлекать ничего не нужно:
**No extraction is needed for translation** — the app reads files straight from the game image.

Extraction is useful if you want to:

- listen to the music and sounds or open the texts in other programs (Kuriimu2, Switch Toolbox);
- translate a game on an engine the app doesn't support yet;
- build the mod by hand.

The files will go into the folder
